      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you show the use of this?  We generally try to avoid storing the Module, although it is probably late enough to do here.  For the bazel conversion we also need to stop affecting modules from their parents, which this seems to be effectively doing by outputting the AndroidMkEntries for the child from the parent.\n\nWould it be possible precompute whatever data will be needed from the Module and store that in AndroidMkEntries instead?",
      "revId": "1f12e1db9c0c57e60146c48cd7a7debccaa1fbfb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
